\ lang! switches ff's texts in the middle of a program; lang@ and .langs
\ report the language in effect: English for one ff has no texts in.
lang@ type cr
.langs
see dup
"ru" lang!
lang@ type cr
.langs
see dup
"de" lang!
lang@ type cr
"ru_RU.UTF-8" lang!
\ Saved and restored: lang@ leaves a copy that outlives the switch.
: in-english  lang@ >r  "en" lang!  lang@ type cr  r> lang! ;
in-english
lang@ type cr
man .langs
